OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over plans for 24-hour
OL,4,Aadult gaming centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunity figures have raised concerns
OL,7,Fover plans for a 24-hour adult gaming
OL,8,Fcentre in Leicester.
OL,10,FMerkur Slots UK has submitted a
OL,11,Fplanning application to Leicester City
OL,12,FCouncil to convert a former vape shop
OL,13,Fand dry cleaners in Evington Road into
OL,14,Fa gambling venue.
OL,16,FAccording to planning documents, the
OL,17,Fproposed centre would "support footfall
OL,18,Fand investment" in the area, as well as
OL,19,Femploy about 12 people.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
