OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over plans for 24-hour
OL,4,Aadult gaming centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FRaffiq Mohammed, Labour city councillor
OL,7,Ffor Stoneygate ward, said the area was
OL,8,Fone of the "most deprived" in the city,
OL,9,Fand added: "To put a gambling casino or
OL,10,Fgambling arcade in this area is asking
OL,11,Fpeople to part with money that they
OL,12,Freally haven't got."
